     2870   END.
     2871   ON VALUE-CHANGED OF v-round-m IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     2872   DO:
     2873     ASSIGN v-round-m .
     2874     if lookup ( v-round-m , 'Произвольно':U ) > 0 then do:
     2875        enable  v-round-base with frame Dialog-Frame .
